      "uid": "zhcn:7ea54d1414f72837ca6bfc90",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "艾尼不就给人一种\n就算在很厉害的地方也能跑赢的感觉吗？\n……应该说我自己也很希望是她赢啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a7b6d8500abc901106f025931786fc77ceb8bb1167f8964ed414e9db45419f7",
