    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef928c893370a5ac094e457d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "早上，\n我把握艾尼斯风神打工的时间，\n边整理资料边拟定下午的训练计划。",
      "source_fingerprint": "489ecd0d5668b80fbfa59751947ace6049ad64bec2c15a5548130bc5f1de9df5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
